\"command module (CM)\",\"service module (SM)\",\"lunar module (LM)\",\"Interplanetary Monitoring Platform (IMP)\",\"Apollo Guidance Computer (AGC)\",\"Gus Grissom\",\"Ed White\",\"Roger B. Chaffee\",\"Apollo 7\",\"Apollo 8\",\"Apollo 9\",\"Apollo 10\"],\"findingCount\":9}}","seal":"31f23b7ad3af54ef98969071fae23c47e0b916076abbea18497a8a65092f09d1"}}

